  "sentence_placements": [
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-01",
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Three notes are on the table: an attendance count, a facilitator availability note, and a room-capacity note.",
      "source_start": 0,
      "source_end": 6.639172,
      "sequence_start": 13.633,
      "sequence_end": 20.272171999999998,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.6353386666666667
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-01",
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "An assistant can turn those into a neat recommendation in seconds.",
      "source_start": 6.639172,
      "source_end": 10.736292500000001,
      "sequence_start": 27.155172,
      "sequence_end": 31.252292499999996,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.8476258333333337
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-01",
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "But if Morgan asks, ‘Where did this come from?’",
      "source_start": 10.736292500000001,
      "source_end": 13.3697055,
      "sequence_start": 38.1352925,
      "sequence_end": 40.768705499999996,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.3025388333333332
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-01",
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "text": "a polished paragraph is thin protection.",
      "source_start": 13.3697055,
      "source_end": 15.7623015,
      "sequence_start": 47.6517055,
      "sequence_end": 50.044301499999996,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.5761348333333327
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-01",
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "text": "The work needs a trail.",
      "source_start": 15.7623015,
      "source_end": 16.952,
      "sequence_start": 56.9273015,
      "sequence_end": 58.117,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-02",
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Our job today is small: design one preparation role and one receipt.",
      "source_start": 17.187,
      "source_end": 21.7820065,
      "sequence_start": 65,
      "sequence_end": 69.5950065,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.4407143651685388
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-02",
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "The agent does not decide whether the session happens.",
      "source_start": 21.7820065,
      "source_end": 24.7223465,
      "sequence_start": 73.61218831818181,
      "sequence_end": 76.5525283181818,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.2653352640449427
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-02",
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "It prepares a Session Option Brief for Morgan to review.",
      "source_start": 24.7223465,
      "source_end": 27.679354,
      "sequence_start": 80.56971013636362,
      "sequence_end": 83.52671763636363,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.2395673483146048
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-02",
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "text": "That distinction matters.",
      "source_start": 27.679354,
      "source_end": 29.2958505,
      "sequence_start": 87.54389945454545,
      "sequence_end": 89.16039595454545,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.3383561179775292
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-02",
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "text": "If we give the system a loose command like ‘run the workshop program,’ we have no useful boundary.",
      "source_start": 29.2958505,
      "source_end": 34.9708275,
      "sequence_start": 93.17757777272726,
      "sequence_end": 98.85255477272725,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.21810508426966635
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-02",
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "text": "What exactly begins its work?",
      "source_start": 34.9708275,
      "source_end": 36.9826415,
      "sequence_start": 102.86973659090907,
      "sequence_end": 104.88155059090907,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.06275385955056123
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-02",
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "text": "What can it read?",
      "source_start": 36.9826415,
      "source_end": 38.1950115,
      "sequence_start": 108.89873240909088,
      "sequence_end": 110.11110240909088,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.10964018539325338
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-02",
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "text": "What must it hand back?",
      "source_start": 38.1950115,
      "source_end": 39.836723500000005,
      "sequence_start": 114.1282842272727,
      "sequence_end": 115.76999622727271,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.1988832415730286
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-02",
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "text": "Who owns the outcome?",
      "source_start": 39.836723500000005,
      "source_end": 41.3197505,
      "sequence_start": 119.78717804545454,
      "sequence_end": 121.27020504545453,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.1006202865168504
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-02",
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "text": "These are ordinary management questions.",
      "source_start": 41.3197505,
      "source_end": 43.897596,
      "sequence_start": 125.28738686363636,
      "sequence_end": 127.86523236363635,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.7462701573033712
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-02",
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "text": "They become more urgent when a tool can produce work while nobody is watching.",
      "source_start": 43.897596,
      "source_end": 47.998,
      "sequence_start": 131.88241418181818,
      "sequence_end": 135.98281818181817,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-03",
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Write the job in one sentence: ‘When Morgan requests a monthly session review, prepare one brief comparing a proposed free session against the three cleared inputs.’",
      "source_start": 48.309,
      "source_end": 57.90551,
      "sequence_start": 140,
      "sequence_end": 149.59651,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.037084468085105016
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-03",
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "The trigger is Morgan's request.",
      "source_start": 57.90551,
      "source_end": 60.172506,
      "sequence_start": 155.37351,
      "sequence_end": 157.64050600000002,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.4657294042553133
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-03",
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "The output is a draft brief.",
      "source_start": 60.172506,
      "source_end": 62.3967005,
      "sequence_start": 163.417506,
      "sequence_end": 165.6417005,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.4839026276595746
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-03",
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "text": "The manager is Morgan.",
      "source_start": 62.3967005,
      "source_end": 63.290532999999996,
      "sequence_start": 171.4187005,
      "sequence_end": 172.31253299999997,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.09294572340425589
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-03",
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "text": "The measure is whether Morgan can check the claim and source for every recommendation without chasing the agent through a log.",
      "source_start": 63.290532999999996,
      "source_end": 71.0695015,
      "sequence_start": 178.08953299999996,
      "sequence_end": 185.86850149999998,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.035051691489371706
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-03",
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "text": "The forbidden actions are just as plain: no booking, no announcement, no message to participants, no spending.",
      "source_start": 71.0695015,
      "source_end": 77.497506,
      "sequence_start": 191.64550149999997,
      "sequence_end": 198.07350599999995,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.14255919148935448
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-03",
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "text": "A useful agent job names the work it finishes and the work it leaves alone.",
      "source_start": 77.497506,
      "source_end": 82.87,
      "sequence_start": 203.85050599999994,
      "sequence_end": 209.22299999999996,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-04",
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Now attach the receipt.",
      "source_start": 83.084,
      "source_end": 84.989898,
      "sequence_start": 215,
      "sequence_end": 216.90589799999998,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.5483424444444438
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-04",
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "Imagine the brief says the room can hold twenty people.",
      "source_start": 84.989898,
      "source_end": 88.1302725,
      "sequence_start": 223.25661228571425,
      "sequence_end": 226.39698678571426,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.2948280555555556
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-04",
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "Morgan needs to see which note supplied that number, when the brief was prepared, what the agent actually did, and whether anyone approved it.",
      "source_start": 88.1302725,
      "source_end": 96.58439899999999,
      "sequence_start": 232.74770107142854,
      "sequence_end": 241.2018275714285,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.6036212222222161
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-04",
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "text": "The receipt also records cost or resource use, outcome, and how to pull the draft back.",
      "source_start": 96.58439899999999,
      "source_end": 102.30280049999999,
      "sequence_start": 247.55254185714278,
      "sequence_end": 253.27094335714278,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.891800499999988
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-04",
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "text": "A blank field stays blank and gets an owner.",
      "source_start": 102.30280049999999,
      "source_end": 104.212007,
      "sequence_start": 259.6216576428571,
      "sequence_end": 261.5308641428571,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.25349300000000596
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-04",
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "text": "We never fill a gap with a confident guess.",
      "source_start": 104.212007,
      "source_end": 108.0268825,
      "sequence_start": 267.8815784285714,
      "sequence_end": 271.6964539285714,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.506882499999989
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-04",
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "text": "The first receipt is a handoff a busy person can understand; the engineering log can remain behind it.",
      "source_start": 108.0268825,
      "source_end": 113.629,
      "sequence_start": 278.04716821428565,
      "sequence_end": 283.64928571428567,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-05",
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "In our case, approval is ‘pending Morgan.’",
      "source_start": 113.863,
      "source_end": 117.117846,
      "sequence_start": 290,
      "sequence_end": 293.254846,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.5182403661971904
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-05",
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "The outcome is ‘draft prepared, no session selected.’",
      "source_start": 117.117846,
      "source_end": 119.511485,
      "sequence_start": 297.795346,
      "sequence_end": 300.188985,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.21566992957747289
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-05",
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "The rollback is ‘withdraw the draft from the review folder and mark it superseded.’",
      "source_start": 119.511485,
      "source_end": 126.35020399999999,
      "sequence_start": 304.729485,
      "sequence_end": 311.56820400000004,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 1.14983780281689
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-05",
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "text": "If the source for room capacity is missing, mark the brief blocked.",
      "source_start": 126.35020399999999,
      "source_end": 130.342177,
      "sequence_start": 316.10870400000005,
      "sequence_end": 320.100677,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.45048685915492115
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-05",
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "text": "A complete-looking card without a source can move bad information faster than an obviously unfinished one.",
      "source_start": 130.342177,
      "source_end": 137.1554195,
      "sequence_start": 324.641177,
      "sequence_end": 331.45441950000003,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 1.0086307676056094
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-05",
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "text": "The receipt makes that gap visible before anyone treats the draft as a decision.",
      "source_start": 137.1554195,
      "source_end": 141.62,
      "sequence_start": 335.99491950000004,
      "sequence_end": 340.45950000000005,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-06",
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Take a moment.",
      "source_start": 141.983,
      "source_end": 142.999592,
      "sequence_start": 345,
      "sequence_end": 346.016592,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.006858666666659019
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-06",
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "Picture one workflow in your own work.",
      "source_start": 142.999592,
      "source_end": 145.526633,
      "sequence_start": 346.82559200000003,
      "sequence_end": 349.352633,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.1778552222222345
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-06",
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "Keep this exercise on paper or in a local draft.",
      "source_start": 145.526633,
      "source_end": 148.66175750000002,
      "sequence_start": 350.16163300000005,
      "sequence_end": 353.29675750000007,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.05279805555554162
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-06",
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "text": "Use a fictional or approved example.",
      "source_start": 148.66175750000002,
      "source_end": 151.17452400000002,
      "sequence_start": 354.1057575000001,
      "sequence_end": 356.6185240000001,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.4405017777777971
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-06",
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "text": "Do not use private operational data.",
      "source_start": 151.17452400000002,
      "source_end": 153.722914,
      "sequence_start": 357.4275240000001,
      "sequence_end": 359.9759140000001,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.9694251111111214
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-06",
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "text": "What is the one useful output, and who would have to defend it?",
      "source_start": 153.722914,
      "source_end": 157.129,
      "sequence_start": 360.78491400000013,
      "sequence_end": 364.1910000000001,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-07",
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Fill the Job and Receipt boxes.",
      "source_start": 157.373,
      "source_end": 159.85051049999998,
      "sequence_start": 365,
      "sequence_end": 367.47751049999994,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.24369471052631297
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-07",
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "Name the trigger, permitted inputs, output, human manager, success check, and three forbidden actions.",
      "source_start": 159.85051049999998,
      "source_end": 164.5029705,
      "sequence_start": 367.72751049999994,
      "sequence_end": 372.37997049999996,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.31608213157895193
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-07",
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "Then fill the nine receipt fields for one imaginary run.",
      "source_start": 164.5029705,
      "source_end": 167.7318705,
      "sequence_start": 372.62997049999996,
      "sequence_end": 375.8588704999999,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.8102084473684101
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-07",
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "text": "If you cannot name a source, approval state, or rollback, write ‘unknown’ and the person who must resolve it.",
      "source_start": 167.7318705,
      "source_end": 175.68731300000002,
      "sequence_start": 376.1088704999999,
      "sequence_end": 384.06431299999986,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.07148405263160384
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-07",
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "text": "Do not open a real system to complete this exercise.",
      "source_start": 175.68731300000002,
      "source_end": 178.61276650000002,
      "sequence_start": 384.31431299999986,
      "sequence_end": 387.23976649999986,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": -0.7260887631578612
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-07",
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "text": "The point is to see the shape of the work before asking a tool to do it.",
      "source_start": 178.61276650000002,
      "source_end": 185.668,
      "sequence_start": 387.48976649999986,
      "sequence_end": 394.54499999999985,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-08",
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Save those two boxes in your Agentified Operating File as a draft.",
      "source_start": 186.031,
      "source_end": 189.955873,
      "sequence_start": 505,
      "sequence_end": 508.924873,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": 0.0345504193548436
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "L01-08",
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "Your stop condition is simple: if the owner, source, or review gate is missing, the draft stays on paper.",
      "source_start": 189.955873,
      "source_end": 196.081,
      "sequence_start": 510.81987300000003,
      "sequence_end": 516.945,
      "alignment_delta_seconds": null
    }
  ],
  "quiet_window": {
    "scene_id": "L01-07",
    "start": 394.54499999999985,
